# Butler Routes - Durotar recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and formulas whose SOURCE
# is physically in Durotar (zone key 1411), verified against the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever item, vendor and drop
# tables). 2 recipes are vendor-sold by Horde vendors in-zone and 2
# drop from named in-zone mobs with 2-droppers-zone-wide tables;
# every other dropped recipe is a generic multi-hundred-zone world
# drop (see docs/durotar-companions-inventory.md), and quest records
# carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md). No
# Blacksmithing plan, Tailoring pattern, Leatherworking pattern,
# Engineering schematic, Enchanting formula, First Aid manual or
# Fishing recipe has a Durotar source in the data - stated, not
# padded. Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own
# profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly.
guide butler-routes-completionist/durotar-recipes
title Durotar - Recipes & Patterns
levels 1-13
zone Durotar
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords durotar, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking - Grimtak (Razor Hill)

  zone map 1411

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 3881 -- Grimtak (51.13,42.63)
  buy 5483 "Recipe: Scorpid Surprise" npc 3881
  note Grimtak (Horde) sells the recipe at Razor Hill (also sold by one vendor on Riverglades). Stock class unconfirmed.

step Cooking - Zansoa (Echo Isles)

  zone map 1411

  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 5942 -- Zansoa (56.06,73.39)
  buy 6326 "Recipe: Slitherskin Mackerel" npc 5942
  note Zansoa (Horde) sells the recipe on the Echo Isles (also sold elsewhere). Stock class unconfirmed.

