step Other professions - no Durotar source

  zone map 1411

  note No Blacksmithing plan, Tailoring pattern, Leatherworking pattern, Engineering schematic, Enchanting formula, First Aid manual or Fishing recipe has a Durotar source in the data - stated, not padded. Trainer-taught staples live in Polestar's own profession guides.
